sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Platform
    participant Adapter as GarakAdapter<br/>(K8s Job Pod)
    participant CredRes as Credential Resolver
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant Garak as Garak CLI<br/>(subprocess / KFP)
    participant Target as Target Model<br/>Endpoint
    participant SDG as sdg-hub<br/>(Synthetic Data Gen)
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>Proxy

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Job pod starts with mounted ConfigMap

    EvalHub->>Adapter: Launch K8s Job with<br/>benchmark configuration
    Adapter->>Adapter: Read job spec from<br/>mounted ConfigMap

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Adapter,CredRes: Credential Resolution (per role)
        Adapter->>CredRes: Resolve API keys for roles<br/>(TARGET, SDG, JUDGE, ATTACKER,<br/>EVALUATOR, TRANSLATION)
        CredRes->>CredRes: Priority chain:<br/>1. Role-specific env var<br/>2. Role-specific secret file<br/>3. Generic API_KEY<br/>4. api-key secret file<br/>5. DUMMY fallback
        CredRes-->>Adapter: Resolved credentials<br/>(redacted for persistence)
    end

    alt Simple Mode (subprocess)
        rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
            Note over Adapter,Garak: Simple Execution Mode
            Adapter->>Adapter: Build garak CLI command
            Adapter->>Garak: Execute subprocess
            Garak->>Target: Inference requests<br/>(red-teaming probes)
            Target-->>Garak: Model responses
            Garak-->>Adapter: JSONL report files<br/>(local filesystem)
        end
    else KFP Mode (pipeline delegation)
        rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
            Note over Adapter,S3: KFP Execution Mode
            Adapter->>S3: Upload config JSON +<br/>intent prompts
            Adapter->>Garak: Submit Kubeflow Pipeline
            Adapter->>Adapter: Poll for completion
            Garak->>Target: Inference requests<br/>(red-teaming probes)
            Target-->>Garak: Model responses
            Garak->>S3: Write results
            Adapter->>S3: Download results
            S3-->>Adapter: JSONL report files
        end
    end

    opt AI Safety (ART) Intents
        rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
            Note over Adapter,SDG: ART Intent Processing
            Adapter->>S3: Fetch taxonomy data<br/>(or use built-in)
            S3-->>Adapter: Taxonomy artifacts
            Adapter->>SDG: Generate synthetic prompts
            SDG-->>Adapter: Generated intent stubs
            Adapter->>Adapter: Normalize prompts +<br/>generate intent stubs
        end
    end

    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JSONL reports +<br/>convert to AVID format
    Adapter->>Adapter: Redact API keys<br/>(replace with ***)
    Adapter->>OCI: Persist artifacts
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results via callback
    Sidecar-->>EvalHub: Aggregated results
